{
  "comment": "Plugin-panel pattern (vibe/slice): bordered groups, legend in the border, one control per fixed-width cell, label under every control. Rows follow the signal path. A group's 'select' picks which copy its knobs edit ({var} in keys); the 'as: select' cell is where that picker sits. 'all' writes every copy at once. 'only' cells dim when their option isn't selected ('fixed' shows a hard-wired destination instead).",
